# What goes into the Airflow image (orchestration/Dockerfile): the DAGs, the plugin, the
# pipeline module and the settings. Overrides the root .dockerignore, which is the ingest
# image's.
*
!config/
!src/stock_analysis/__init__.py
!src/stock_analysis/pipeline/
!orchestration/dags/
!orchestration/plugins/
**/__pycache__
